  Slug: weapon-expertise
  DisplayName: Weapon Expertise
  IconPath: icons/skills/melee/hand-grip-sword-red.webp
  Description: Champion, Exemplar, Investigator, Magus You've dedicated yourself
    to learning the intricacies of your weapons. Your proficiency ranks for simple
    weapons, martial weapons, and unarmed attacks increase to expert. Druid, Kineticist
    You've improved your combat skill. Your proficiency rank for simple weapons and
    unarmed attacks increases to expert. Oracle You've dedicated yourself to learning
    the intricacies of your weapons. Your proficiency ranks for simple weapons and
    unarmed attacks increase to expert. Psychic Training and magic improved your
    weapon technique. Your proficiency rank for simple weapons and unarmed attacks
    increases to expert. Sorcerer You've improved your combat skill. Your proficiency
    ranks for simple weapons and unarmed attacks increase to expert. Swashbuckler
    You've dedicated yourself to learning the intricacies of your weapons. Your proficiency
    ranks for simple weapons, martial weapons, and unarmed attacks increase to expert.
    You gain access to the critical specialization effects of all weapons for which
    you have expert proficiency. Witch, Wizard Through sheer experience, you've improved
    your technique with your weapons. Your proficiency ranks for simple weapons and
    unarmed attacks increase to expert.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Player Core
